      "FacilityID": 1000123069,
      "SummaryText": "Risk Management Plan\nPleasant Grove Retail, Grow West\nPleasant Grove, California\n\n\nEXECUTIVE SUMMARY (19 CCR 2745.3)\n\n\nES-1.0 FACILITY ACCIDENTAL RELEASE POLICY\n\nThe owners, management, and employees of the Pleasant Grove Retail, part of Grow West (herein referred to as Pleasant Grove or the Pleasant Grove Facility) at 4036 Pleasant Grove Road, Pleasant Grove, California 95668 are committed to the prevention of any accidental release of aqua ammonia. If an accidental release should occur, the Facility is prepared to work with the local fire department, or other authorities, to mitigate any release and minimize the impact of the release to people and the environment. A detailed Consolidated Contingency Plan (CCP) has been developed and will be implemented in the event of an accidental release.\n\n\nES-2.0 FACILITY INFORMATION\n\nThe Facility is a retail agricultural facility whose primary activity is the storage and sale of fertilizers in addition to the sale of pre-packaged agricultural chemicals to agricultural operations in the Sacramento Valley of Northern California. Applicable NAICS codes for this facility include 42491 (Farm Supplies Merchant Wholesalers).\n\nGrow West has removed the aqua ammonia from this property. Grow West has filed for deregistration with the U.S.EPA"
    }
